AE2 Crystal Science: Legacy — Licensing Overview
================================================

This project is an unofficial Minecraft 1.12.2 port of Applied Energistics:
Crystal Science (AECS). It uses a multi-license structure. Different portions
of the project are governed by different licenses; this overview does not
replace the complete license texts in the LICENSES directory.

1. Source code
--------------

License: GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.0 or later
(SPDX: LGPL-3.0-or-later)

Applies to:
- Source code under src/main/java/
- Source-derived scripts and implementation files, unless a file carries a
  different license notice

Original AECS code:
- Copyright (c) 2026 Frostbite-time
- Copyright (c) 2026 Lounode

Minecraft 1.12.2 port and subsequent modifications:
- Copyright (c) 2026 KleinBlue

AE2-derived portions remain subject to their original copyright and license:
- Copyright (c) 2013-2020 AlgorithmX2 et al.
- GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.0

The complete LGPL-3.0 license text is available at:
- LICENSES/LGPL-3.0.txt

