4. Distribution notice
-----------------------

Redistribution of this port, in source or binary form, must comply with the
license applicable to each portion. In particular, preserve copyright and
license notices, identify modified versions, provide the corresponding source
as required by LGPL-3.0-or-later, and satisfy the attribution,
